{{> racing-subnav}}

{{> page-header image="/images/racing/hero.jpg" eyebrow="01 · Kidney Distress" heading="The Cost of Physiological Stress" subheading="During intense racing and training, the kidneys face extraordinary demands to regulate blood pressure, fluid balance, electrolytes, acid-base balance, and oxygen transport. When the kidney can no longer maintain optimal homeostasis under extreme athletic stress, the body's performance systems begin to lose efficiency—often long before visible signs of fatigue or injury appear."}}

<section class="panel-grey">
  <div class="section max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">Why Kidney Health Matters</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">The outward signs of fatigue, slower recovery, reduced oxygen delivery, and declining performance are reflections of changes occurring within the kidney itself. Comparing a healthy kidney with one under extreme physiological stress helps explain why maintaining homeostasis is essential for peak athletic performance.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-none border border-green-700/25 bg-green-50 p-7">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-green-800">{{comparison.normal.label}}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-700">{{comparison.normal.tagline}}</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          {{#each comparison.normal.points}}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            {{{icon "check" "w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-green-700"}}}
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-al-navy">{{this.title}}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-al-ink/65">{{this.body}}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          {{/each}}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-none bg-white p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-green-700">Result: Optimal Performance</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-xs text-al-ink/70">
            {{#each comparison.normal.result}}
            <li>&bull; {{this}}</li>
            {{/each}}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-none border border-red-700/25 bg-red-50 p-7">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-red-800">{{comparison.stress.label}}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-700">{{comparison.stress.tagline}}</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          {{#each comparison.stress.points}}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            {{{icon "close" "w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-red-700"}}}
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-al-navy">{{this.title}}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-al-ink/65">{{this.body}}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          {{/each}}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-none bg-white p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-700">Result: Reduced Performance &amp; Recovery</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-xs text-al-ink/70">
            {{#each comparison.stress.result}}
            <li>&bull; {{this}}</li>
            {{/each}}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-white">
  <div class="section grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/55">02</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">The Kidney: Where Performance Is Won or Lost</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">The fatigue you see on the track begins long before it becomes visible. As the kidney struggles to maintain physiological homeostasis under extreme athletic demands, oxygen delivery, recovery, and performance begin to decline.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-none border border-al-line bg-al-panel p-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-navy/55">03</p>
      <h2 class="font-display mt-2 text-2xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">Restoring the Body's Natural Balance</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">The goal isn't simply to treat the symptoms of physiological stress&mdash;it's to help the body maintain the homeostasis that allows every performance system to function at its best. That's where VetroFit begins.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="panel-grey">
  <div class="section text-center">
    <p class="font-display mx-auto max-w-2xl text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-al-navy sm:text-3xl">As the master regulator of the body's physiological systems, a healthy kidney helps maintain the homeostasis required for peak performance, efficient recovery, and long-term athletic health.</p>
    <a href="/racing/vetrofit" class="btn-primary mt-10">Shop VetroFit&reg;</a>
  </div>
</section>
